WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.969 --> 00:00:06.580
Hey youtubers it’s charlie and arrow finally
introduced nyssa al ghul and filled in a lot

00:00:06.580 --> 00:00:09.200
of backstory for several of the characters.

00:00:09.200 --> 00:00:12.940
Bonus shout out to doctor who fans because
alex kingston came back too.

00:00:12.940 --> 00:00:19.509
So there’s a bunch of Arrow news and Flash
news that I have in addition to my review.

00:00:19.509 --> 00:00:21.952
So I’ll include all the flash stuff in a
separate video I’m posting tomorrow.

00:00:21.952 --> 00:00:23.230
Be sure to subscribe to get that.

00:00:23.230 --> 00:00:26.339
I’ll add all the arrow related news after
my review.

00:00:26.339 --> 00:00:30.880
Careful for spoilers from tonight’s episode.

00:00:30.880 --> 00:00:33.810
Let’s start with our top 5 moments.

00:00:33.810 --> 00:00:36.500
Number 5 - Moira VS Brother Blood.

00:00:36.500 --> 00:00:40.500
In an episode all about venom it seemed like
Moria was the most dangerous snake.

00:00:40.500 --> 00:00:44.840
Their big confrontation came right after oliver
and felicity got done talking about fangs

00:00:44.840 --> 00:00:48.920
and throughout the episode Moira had this
lionel luthor look on her face.

00:00:48.920 --> 00:00:50.180
If you didn’t watch smallville.

00:00:50.180 --> 00:00:52.240
He was the nicest bad guy in the world.

00:00:52.240 --> 00:00:55.950
It’s easier to understand why Merlin would
have been someone she was attracted too.

00:00:55.950 --> 00:00:59.660
The good thing about her taking on brother
blood is that he’ll have to defend against

00:00:59.660 --> 00:01:01.990
her and team arrow at the same time.

00:01:01.990 --> 00:01:05.100
Pending whatever Slade does to quote unquote
take care of it.

00:01:05.100 --> 00:01:08.040
Number 4 - Felicity tells Oliver about Thea.

00:01:08.040 --> 00:01:10.930
This was a meta moment that Stephen Amell
had been teasing.

00:01:10.930 --> 00:01:14.220
He said that felicity would get some backstory
in this episode.

00:01:14.220 --> 00:01:17.640
And when she explained thea to oliver she
talked about her father leaving and filled

00:01:17.640 --> 00:01:21.213
in some really critical information about
why she is the way she is.

00:01:21.213 --> 00:01:24.940
Emily Bett is awesome, mostly when she and
Stephen Amell are in a scene together.

00:01:24.940 --> 00:01:26.909
Oliver’s reaction was really good too.

00:01:26.909 --> 00:01:30.690
If you didn’t catch it, when he went up
to the podium that read Queen for Mayor it

00:01:30.690 --> 00:01:32.970
was a huge shoutout to the comic books.

00:01:32.970 --> 00:01:38.600
The Green Arrow became the mayor of the city.

00:01:38.600 --> 00:01:42.260
I keep expecting Merlin to appear in the background
every time they say his name.

00:01:42.260 --> 00:01:44.840
Number 3 - Canary &amp; Nyssa ship.

00:01:44.840 --> 00:01:48.470
They kind of teased us with that line ‘the
child of rashe al ghul’ awaits your return.

00:01:48.470 --> 00:01:52.840
I thought it might have been a sexual relationship,
but they wasted no time in answering that

00:01:52.840 --> 00:01:53.840
question.

00:01:53.840 --> 00:01:57.600
Think of Nyssa as the oliver of that relationship
and sara as the felicity.

00:01:57.600 --> 00:02:01.950
Be sure to give the arrow writers a high five
for including some real diversity in the dc

00:02:01.950 --> 00:02:02.950
universe.

00:02:02.950 --> 00:02:06.830
Lesbian and Bisexual characters aren’t new
to the comics, but it’s not something male

00:02:06.830 --> 00:02:09.379
driven comic book tv shows do very often.

00:02:09.379 --> 00:02:12.160
I thought it was interesting that nyssa released
the canary from the league.

00:02:12.160 --> 00:02:14.020
I thought that only rashe al ghul could do
that.

00:02:14.020 --> 00:02:16.640
And when he does it it’s usually by chopping
you in half.

00:02:16.640 --> 00:02:19.190
Number 2 - Slade steps into the ring.

00:02:19.190 --> 00:02:23.070
Manu Bennett has been such a post-credits
character this season.

00:02:23.070 --> 00:02:27.190
It’s like all his biggest scenes have been
in the last 3 minutes of each episode.

00:02:27.190 --> 00:02:29.010
His comment, “i’ll take care of it.

00:02:29.010 --> 00:02:35.230
Makes it sound like he’s finally going to
confront team arrow as deathstroke.

00:02:35.230 --> 00:02:40.880
It feels like he’ll reveal himself to oliver
as slade after he fights them as deathstroke.

00:02:40.880 --> 00:02:42.640
It’s a classic villain reveal.

00:02:42.640 --> 00:02:47.319
I wonder who this mystery assasin is? which
leads to, Oh shit, it’s that guy I stabbed

00:02:47.319 --> 00:02:49.730
in the eye and left for dead six years ago.

00:02:49.730 --> 00:02:52.770
Number 1 - The emerald archer versus the heir
to the demon..

00:02:52.770 --> 00:02:54.270
Best fight this season hands down.

00:02:54.270 --> 00:02:57.160
It was like they were trying to see who could
out arrow each other.

00:02:57.160 --> 00:02:59.890
I guess archery is a big deal in the league.

00:02:59.890 --> 00:03:02.000
First there’s merlin, then oliver, now nyssa.

00:03:02.000 --> 00:03:04.440
Even the canary is a deadshot with oliver’s
bow.

00:03:04.440 --> 00:03:08.180
I really liked Katrina Law as nyssa in the
episode, hopefully she’ll come back in a

00:03:08.180 --> 00:03:10.530
future episode.

00:03:10.530 --> 00:03:14.580
Honorable mention goes to the car chase scene.

00:03:14.580 --> 00:03:17.770
Oliver vs nyssa was the best fight of the
episode, but the car chase was the best stunt.

00:03:17.770 --> 00:03:22.140
I like how the canary screamed out as if she
were doing the comic book version of her canary

00:03:22.140 --> 00:03:23.140
cry.

00:03:23.140 --> 00:03:26.069
Let me know what your favorite moment was.

00:03:26.069 --> 00:03:29.150
Seeing Nyssa, seeing nyssa and the canary.

00:03:29.150 --> 00:03:31.810
I saw a hashtag on twitter that said syssa.

00:03:31.810 --> 00:03:34.269
Or was it the big fight scene.

00:03:34.269 --> 00:03:36.110
For me it was definitely the fight scene.

00:03:36.110 --> 00:03:38.200
My favorite character moment was felicity
and oliver though.

00:03:38.200 --> 00:03:40.010
They’re so good togeher on screen you could
almost forget it a show about comic book characters.

00:03:40.010 --> 00:03:42.810
Although I have to give a shout out to caity
lotz for giving stephen amell a run for his

00:03:42.810 --> 00:03:44.490
money on the salmon ladders.

00:03:44.490 --> 00:03:45.710
Overall I loved the episode.

00:03:45.710 --> 00:03:50.220
I actually gave it an A just because it gave
us so much story and still had some amazing

00:03:50.220 --> 00:03:52.250
action scenes and made us want to cry a little.

00:03:52.250 --> 00:03:56.909
I didn’t cry, but everytime felicity cries
I almost want to cry just because her character

00:03:56.909 --> 00:03:57.909
is so sympathetic.

00:03:57.909 --> 00:04:00.260
High fives to emily bett for making everyone
cry.

00:04:00.260 --> 00:04:02.100
I’m still not digging laurel’s arc.

00:04:02.100 --> 00:04:06.580
Sassy sisters was not fun to watch, I like
watching evil characters be evil, like slade

00:04:06.580 --> 00:04:07.930
getting ready to kick some ass.

00:04:07.930 --> 00:04:11.051
But I can’t stand watching good characters
be awful to each other.

00:04:11.051 --> 00:04:12.170
I’m not a big fan of depressing melodrama
either, so watching laurel slowly flush her

00:04:12.170 --> 00:04:13.750
life down the toilet has not been fun.

00:04:13.750 --> 00:04:16.299
The show does do a good job of surprising
you.

00:04:16.299 --> 00:04:19.410
I geniunely belived sara was going to kill
herself and jump start the laurel black canary

00:04:19.410 --> 00:04:20.410
arc.

00:04:20.410 --> 00:04:23.030
But then remembered all the birds of prey
talk the writers were doing last week.

00:04:23.030 --> 00:04:25.120
So now it’s time for big arrow news and
things that are coming up.

00:04:25.120 --> 00:04:28.220
Careful for spoilers from the rest of the
season.

00:04:28.220 --> 00:04:32.160
Starting where we’re at, Sara is back for
good now and part of the arrowcave.

00:04:32.160 --> 00:04:34.600
It’s starting to get crowded with Roy in
there too now.

00:04:34.600 --> 00:04:37.620
It’s going to be a salmon ladder party.

00:04:37.620 --> 00:04:42.410
Starting next week with episode 14 and extending
to episode 18 it’s really a villain’s

00:04:42.410 --> 00:04:43.410
arc on arrow.

00:04:43.410 --> 00:04:46.580
The comic book reference used to describe
it was Villains United.

00:04:46.580 --> 00:04:50.900
That includes a public appearance from deathstroke,
a real deal suicide squad and the birds of

00:04:50.900 --> 00:04:51.900
prey.

00:04:51.900 --> 00:04:56.000
16 will be the suicide squad episode and 17
will be the birds of prey episode.

00:04:56.000 --> 00:05:02.300
So you can see how as the villains stakes
rise, a group of heroes has to come help team

00:05:02.300 --> 00:05:03.300
arrow.

00:05:03.300 --> 00:05:05.700
In related news, I told you I’m doing a
special video for the flash.

00:05:05.700 --> 00:05:08.949
I’ll probably post that tomorrow in addition
to my next Q&amp;A video.

00:05:08.949 --> 00:05:12.810
So ask me as many questions as you like.

00:05:12.810 --> 00:05:14.270
Right Now click here to get that flash video.

00:05:14.270 --> 00:05:15.640
I’ll add the annotation as soon as I post
the video.

00:05:15.640 --> 00:05:18.230
And click here for last week’s arrow.

00:05:18.230 --> 00:05:20.440
Thanks for watching, see you guys tonight.

00:05:20.440 --> 00:05:21.180
High Fives!

